{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_epistemic_ledger_poc_spec_v4_epistemic_ledger_poc_04_agent_protocol_s4_3", "label": "04 \u00a74.3 \u2014 Extraction is proposal-only", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-21-large-requests.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "implementation_implemented_stage_21_large_requests_stage", "label": "Stage 21 \u2014 Large requests from a connector (implemented)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-21-large-requests.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Every piece already existed \u2014 the outline is Stage 20, the per-leaf CLAIM_EXTRACTION is P0, the volunteer answers through Stage 18, the proposal-only rule of 04 \u00a74.3 and Stage 19's accept_proposal are the review step. This stage carries them over the connector in the order an assistant needs and adds the one judgment the server cannot make: the size rule."}, {"id": "implementation_implemented_stage_21_large_requests_size_rule", "label": "The size rule \u2014 outline first above roughly 3,000 words", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-21-large-requests.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "An assistant never records a partial check as if it were whole. The server enforces what it can: a statement over 2,000 characters, or more than 40 new claims without sections in one bundle, is refused with a reply pointing at create_outline. The judgment itself lives in the guidance, because the server cannot measure whether the assistant read the sources."}, {"id": "implementation_implemented_stage_21_large_requests_create_outline", "label": "create_outline \u2014 source, one location per leaf, one CREATE_SECTION, one extraction task per leaf", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-21-large-requests.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Anonymous like record_investigation, so no token is needed to start a big job. A 60-leaf outline is about 62 writes, and the packet carries the locator, heading and anchor as untrusted_excerpt so the volunteer reads the range in the source itself: Galedra never fetches. The reply's `next` is the exact sentence to say, ending in the question whether to start on the research now."}, {"id": "implementation_implemented_stage_21_large_requests_section_check", "label": "A section check \u2014 record_investigation with `section` per claim", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-21-large-requests.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "When every claim sits under one root the reply's share line is the outline's counts line rather than a verdict, and the leaf's open CLAIM_EXTRACTION task is set CANCELLED with RECORDED_BY_REQUESTER \u2014 the task is not a log entry, so cancelling it is not a correction."}, {"id": "implementation_implemented_stage_21_large_requests_named_assistant_cap", "label": "Daily cap 1,000 for named assistants, 200 for anonymous", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-21-large-requests.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "An outline plus its claims is far more writes than a meme check, and a named assistant has a principal someone can hold to account; the cap message names the outline so the assistant can say how far it got and that the rest is open work."}, {"id": "implementation_implemented_stage_21_large_requests_requester_accepts", "label": "The requester may accept its volunteers' extractions", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-21-large-requests.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "It is a different principal from the extractor, and accepting makes every accepted claim its principal's responsibility, which is also what lets its tasks on those claims be worked by others and not by itself. The applier still refuses the extractor's own principal."}], "edges": [{"source": "implementation_implemented_stage_21_large_requests_stage", "target": "implementation_implemented_stage_21_large_requests_size_rule", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-21-large-requests.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "implementation_implemented_stage_21_large_requests_stage", "target": "implementation_implemented_stage_21_large_requests_create_outline", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-21-large-requests.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "implementation_implemented_stage_21_large_requests_stage", "target": "implementation_implemented_stage_21_large_requests_section_check", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-21-large-requests.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "implementation_implemented_stage_21_large_requests_stage", "target": "implementation_implemented_stage_21_large_requests_named_assistant_cap", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-21-large-requests.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "implementation_implemented_stage_21_large_requests_stage", "target": "implementation_implemented_stage_21_large_requests_requester_accepts", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-21-large-requests.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "implementation_implemented_stage_21_large_requests_create_outline", "target": "app_services_investigations_outline_outline", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-21-large-requests.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "implementation_implemented_stage_21_large_requests_create_outline", "target": "app_services_tasks_build_context_buildcontext", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-21-large-requests.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "implementation_implemented_stage_21_large_requests_section_check", "target": "app_services_investigations_record_record", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-21-large-requests.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "implementation_implemented_stage_21_large_requests_stage", "target": "app_services_tasks_answer_answer", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-21-large-requests.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "implementation_implemented_stage_21_large_requests_stage", "target": "app_services_tasks_open_verification_openverification", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-21-large-requests.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "implementation_implemented_stage_21_large_requests_stage", "target": "app_services_tasks_lease_lease", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score"